  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">CTR Fortalecimiento Sistema Nacional Inversin Pblica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RTC Strengthening National System Public Investment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OBJECTIVE IS TO STRENGTHEN THE NATIONAL SYSTEM OF PUBLIC INVESTMENT IN ECUADOR WITH SIX SPECIFIC GOALS: 1) STREGTHEN THE PROGRAMMING PROCESS;2) STREGTHEN THE SISTEM OF CONTROL AND TRACKING OF PROJECTS;3) TRAINING IN FORMULATING, EVALUATING, PROGRAMMING AND TRACKING OF INVESTMENT AND PREINVESTMENT PROJECTS;4) DEVELOP THE SECTORIAL PROGRAMMING OF PROJECTS;5) EVALUATION OF SUSPENDED PROJECTS;6) PREPARATION OF A NATIONAL INVESTMENT LAW.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
